  "$comment": "仅业务/宿主变量，非 DS token。新增须 PR + EDS 维护者 approve。",
  "allow": [
    "--app-preview-width",
    "--app-preview-height",
    "--app-preview-min-width",
    "--app-preview-min-height"
  ]
}
```

